            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo, Munguú Israeli, i kaahi, «Ga/aaweek aníng Amoni munguú Tebesi un muúx, nee Farao nee yaamaá Misriro dinkwa nee munguii'ine nee waawitaáine, nee kudá' Farao gwaa harahhifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng inooín i qaás baraá dabaá kudá' slafingw'ín ngu leelehhitá', nee baraá dabaá Nebukadnesa waawutmoó Babuloni nee geeraharuuse. Aluuwo yaamaá Misri kiwa hoot adoodá' aáng i dirii'iya'. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
